               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Our manufacturing unit spreads over large area that helps us to</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Our manufacturing unit spreads over large area that helps us to provide all the facilities in house under one roof. We have well managed administartive department , work areas (sheds), godowns, labour quaters, quality control       department &amp; more.</photoshop:LayerText>
