                  <photoshop:LayerText>the right time!</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Our vision for the rug industry is to weave a sustainable and v</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Our vision for the rug industry is to weave a sustainable and vibrant future. Through cutting-edge technology and timeless artistry, we aspire to create products that not only adorn, but also inspire. With a commitment to eco-conscious practices, we strive to be a beacon of sustainability, leaving behind a world where every thread tells a story of responsible production and timeless beauty."</photoshop:LayerText>
