               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Real Carpets India is one of the Rugs &amp; Carpets manufacturing h</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Real Carpets India is one of the Rugs &amp; Carpets manufacturing house, with expertise in Hand-Tufted, Hand-Woven, Hand-Knitted,     Machine-Tufted &amp; Braided constructions. It provides complete â€œFloor Coveringâ€ solutions to customers.  Our dedicated designing &amp; merchandising team work with our       customers to develop custom made programs. Our each product is crafted in sustainable environment and carries its own identity and stands with international quality standards. Real Carpets India has completely integrated manufacturing set-up with organized system and work practices as per ISO 9001 quality standards. </photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
